WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.562
Let’s walk through Watch the live tracker.

00:00:02.562 --> 00:00:05.225
Use the shared tracker as the reference before and after

00:00:05.225 --> 00:00:07.312
every operator state change.

00:00:07.312 --> 00:00:10.300
Announce material changes to the room and confirm that all

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.475
roles now see the intended move, phase, countdown

00:00:13.475 --> 00:00:14.900
, and running state.

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:17.325
On this slide, the header mirrors the current state

00:00:17.325 --> 00:00:18.812
every team sees:

00:00:18.812 --> 00:00:22.750
Strategic Orientation before Move 1, then move, phase

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:25.887
, countdown timer, and paused or running state.

00:00:26.435 --> 00:00:30.198
In practice, announce material state changes to the room

00:00:30.198 --> 00:00:34.535
and verify the shared display before moving the exercise forward

00:00:34.535 --> 00:00:34.735
.

00:00:34.735 --> 00:00:38.373
Use the highlighted Live tracker area as your visual reference

00:00:38.373 --> 00:00:40.035
while you complete this check.
